{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ezmeralda</i> is a top-down action RPG where exploration, combat, and discovery go hand in hand. <br>You play as a wandering hero drawn into mysterious dungeons, haunted caves, and ancient ruins. Armed with steel and courage, you\u2019ll face challenging enemies, powerful bosses, and hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced combat</strong> \u2013 Hack and slash your way through hordes of enemies using swords, skills, and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon crawling</strong> \u2013 Explore handcrafted and procedurally generated areas filled with secrets, traps, and loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging boss fights</strong> \u2013 Test your skills against unique bosses with special attack patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character progression</strong> \u2013 Gain experience, unlock new abilities, and equip powerful gear to shape your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer support</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends to explore and conquer the world together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to dive deep into dungeons alone or join allies on an adventure, <i>Esmeralda</i> offers a classic RPG experience with a modern touch.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981220?t=1758951674","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981220/415615eb589db2b602649c2ad8ebf66d43a1394c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758951674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981220/e145cd06e26d80a688fc240fa9748f34305f1a74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758951674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981220/e145cd06e26d80a688fc240fa9748f343